{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"poem-black-star-rising","version":1,"title":"Black Star Rising (a poem)","ageTiers":["9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"On the sixth of March, in fifty-seven,\nThe morning rose like gold;\nA people stood in the Accra heat\nAnd a new tale began to unfold.","sentences":["On the sixth of March, in fifty-seven,\nThe morning rose like gold;\nA people stood in the Accra heat\nAnd a new tale began to unfold."],"alt":"A crowd gathers in Accra at sunrise under a golden sky.","image":{"hash":"sha256:cb9a300791f9532fce8abf538cd8970098a170995fd734c85458558aa31bdb14","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d314d02cf53b71ed6ce6f16b92fe827d32964240a4e429f4880441f0def3e08f","durationMs":17560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,17560]],"words":[[0,283],[283,708],[708,1416],[1416,1699],[1699,3115],[3115,3398],[3398,5522],[5522,5947],[5947,6938],[6938,7504],[7504,8070],[8070,9345],[9345,9628],[9628,10478],[10478,11186],[11186,11469],[11469,11894],[11894,12602],[12602,13168],[13168,13593],[13593,13876],[13876,14301],[14301,14867],[14867,15575],[15575,15858],[15858,17560]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Red for the blood of those who fought,\nGold for the wealth in the ground,\nGreen for the forest and the farm,\nA Black Star for Africa, safe and sound.","sentences":["Red for the blood of those who fought,\nGold for the wealth in the ground,\nGreen for the forest and the farm,\nA Black Star for Africa, safe and sound."],"alt":"A flag in red, gold and green with a black star flutters in the wind.","image":{"hash":"sha256:81ba20858c90b2feea97ffbaeae5c2135fc09cc126b864faefc351dbb2c86531","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:7fe7552201c1f2c37c094230a93d3266b2f3c3a34efb91f0c74286e7f8e151ab","durationMs":18480,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,18480]],"words":[[0,390],[390,780],[780,1170],[1170,1821],[1821,2081],[2081,2732],[2732,3122],[3122,4554],[4554,5075],[5075,5465],[5465,5855],[5855,6636],[6636,6896],[6896,7286],[7286,8718],[8718,9369],[9369,9759],[9759,10149],[10149,10930],[10930,11320],[11320,11710],[11710,12881],[12881,13141],[13141,13792],[13792,14313],[14313,14703],[14703,16135],[16135,16656],[16656,17046],[17046,18480]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"The drums spoke loud across the crowd,\nThe flags danced in the breeze,\nAnd hope rose up like morning mist\nAbove the tall palm trees.","sentences":["The drums spoke loud across the crowd,\nThe flags danced in the breeze,\nAnd hope rose up like morning mist\nAbove the tall palm trees."],"alt":"Drummers play as flags wave above a crowd beneath palm trees.","image":{"hash":"sha256:748fa945a9751f93d336adbe517cbd64af2d3db0db133c0320a573e1bf9c7468","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d2eb8a9c1f3f8576b97a9ea71e7c5cff62381a0984a29c9b410282b428852ca8","durationMs":15680,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,15680]],"words":[[0,389],[389,1037],[1037,1685],[1685,2203],[2203,2981],[2981,3370],[3370,4666],[4666,5055],[5055,5703],[5703,6481],[6481,6740],[6740,7129],[7129,8554],[8554,8943],[8943,9461],[9461,9979],[9979,10238],[10238,10756],[10756,11663],[11663,12181],[12181,12829],[12829,13218],[13218,13736],[13736,14254],[14254,15680]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"But freedom is not a finish line;\nIt is a road we walk.\nIt asks for hands that build and learn\nAnd honest words that talk.","sentences":["But freedom is not a finish line;\nIt is a road we walk.","It asks for hands that build and learn\nAnd honest words that talk."],"alt":"A long road crossing a green landscape with people walking and building.","image":{"hash":"sha256:85aef15b810c51a3af00aed6de242a9133cd800e3ea036999b83d998e45ed5f5","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:eafa75c535f836534a2c1a8fd8cc52bcdd2197b26b376254d4a5628be270d919","durationMs":15520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,7761],[7761,15520]],"words":[[0,395],[395,1316],[1316,1579],[1579,1974],[1974,2237],[2237,3026],[3026,4210],[4210,4473],[4473,4736],[4736,4999],[4999,5525],[5525,5788],[5788,7761],[7761,8024],[8024,8550],[8550,8945],[8945,9603],[9603,10129],[10129,10787],[10787,11182],[11182,11840],[11840,12235],[12235,13024],[13024,13682],[13682,14208],[14208,15520]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"So when you see the Black Star shine\nOn cloth, on arch, on field,\nRemember: light is something shared,\nAnd a nation is a shield.","sentences":["So when you see the Black Star shine\nOn cloth, on arch, on field,\nRemember: light is something shared,\nAnd a nation is a shield."],"alt":"A black star on a cloth, an arch and a football field, with a shield behind them.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c06c261f40f573b5fa2d1d27cc948c34e25f6a0c34bc5c914e0e4e6b82b2d16a","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:3acf77387b0fa7ab45a53a7d200d52620ce22d82fb1a60b7a3720fcabb8e7bb9","durationMs":18440,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,18440]],"words":[[0,282],[282,845],[845,1267],[1267,1689],[1689,2111],[2111,2815],[2815,3378],[3378,4082],[4082,4364],[4364,5772],[5772,6054],[6054,7321],[7321,7603],[7603,9011],[9011,10841],[10841,11545],[11545,11827],[11827,13094],[13094,14642],[14642,15064],[15064,15346],[15346,16191],[16191,16473],[16473,16755],[16755,18440]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Rise, young Ghana, read and dream,\nBe a lantern in the night;\nThe star above the gate is yours—\nNow carry on its light.","sentences":["Rise, young Ghana, read and dream,\nBe a lantern in the night;\nThe star above the gate is yours—\nNow carry on its light."],"alt":"A young person holds a lantern at night beneath a large star over a gate.","image":{"hash":"sha256:9e80976634342d4dcbe36f56a0e001e3b03d84c404e46318c0dd6933ad228f28","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:b81a0eb6b6d8166841d74d2056077a56e34cfdc503a9e6183675dd0a21aa1afb","durationMs":14800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,14800]],"words":[[0,1092],[1092,1699],[1699,2912],[2912,3397],[3397,3761],[3761,4974],[4974,5217],[5217,5460],[5460,6309],[6309,6552],[6552,6916],[6916,8129],[8129,8493],[8493,8978],[8978,9585],[9585,9949],[9949,10434],[10434,10677],[10677,11890],[11890,12254],[12254,12861],[12861,13104],[13104,13468],[13468,14800]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"bs-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":2,"question":"According to the poem, what does gold stand for?","options":["The wealth in the ground","The sun","The forest"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"bs-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"Which figure of speech is “hope rose up like morning mist”?","options":["A simile","A metaphor","Hyperbole"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"It uses “like” to compare hope to mist."},{"id":"bs-c3","type":"comprehension","afterPage":4,"question":"What does “freedom is not a finish line, it is a road we walk” mean?","options":["Freedom needs continued effort","Freedom is easy","Freedom ends"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"This is a metaphor: freedom is compared to a road, showing it is ongoing."},{"id":"bs-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":4,"targetSound":"alk","prompt":"In the fourth stanza, which two words rhyme?","options":["walk","talk","learn"],"correctIndexes":[0,1]},{"id":"bs-c4","type":"comprehension","afterPage":5,"question":"Which line is a metaphor?","options":["A nation is a shield","Like morning mist","Red for the blood"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"It says a nation is a shield without using like or as."},{"id":"bs-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":6,"prompt":"The last stanza asks young people to be lanterns. What can you do to be a light for your community?","feelingOptions":["Inspired","Proud","Determined","Hopeful"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"unfold","definition":"To open out slowly and be revealed.","pages":[1]},{"word":"wealth","definition":"A large amount of valuable things.","pages":[2]},{"word":"shield","definition":"Something that protects.","pages":[5]},{"word":"lantern","definition":"A lamp with a handle that gives light.","pages":[6]}],"assets":{"sha256:cb9a300791f9532fce8abf538cd8970098a170995fd734c85458558aa31bdb14":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page1-1.webp","bytes":143908,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:d314d02cf53b71ed6ce6f16b92fe827d32964240a4e429f4880441f0def3e08f":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/d314d02cf53b.mp3","bytes":70700,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:81ba20858c90b2feea97ffbaeae5c2135fc09cc126b864faefc351dbb2c86531":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page2-1.webp","bytes":119798,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:7fe7552201c1f2c37c094230a93d3266b2f3c3a34efb91f0c74286e7f8e151ab":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/7fe7552201c1.mp3","bytes":74348,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:748fa945a9751f93d336adbe517cbd64af2d3db0db133c0320a573e1bf9c7468":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page3-1.webp","bytes":134556,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:d2eb8a9c1f3f8576b97a9ea71e7c5cff62381a0984a29c9b410282b428852ca8":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/d2eb8a9c1f3f.mp3","bytes":63212,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:85aef15b810c51a3af00aed6de242a9133cd800e3ea036999b83d998e45ed5f5":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page4-1.webp","bytes":152764,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:eafa75c535f836534a2c1a8fd8cc52bcdd2197b26b376254d4a5628be270d919":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/eafa75c535f8.mp3","bytes":62540,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:c06c261f40f573b5fa2d1d27cc948c34e25f6a0c34bc5c914e0e4e6b82b2d16a":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page5-1.webp","bytes":83532,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:3acf77387b0fa7ab45a53a7d200d52620ce22d82fb1a60b7a3720fcabb8e7bb9":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/3acf77387b0f.mp3","bytes":74252,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:9e80976634342d4dcbe36f56a0e001e3b03d84c404e46318c0dd6933ad228f28":{"path":"/story-spa